==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|án}}, {{m|non|ón}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*ēnu}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈauːn/}}
* {{rhymes|is|auːn|s=1}}
* {{IPA|is|/ˈaun/}} (when forming a phonetic unit with an unaccented pronoun, e.g. {{m|is||án þess|without it}}: {{IPA|is|/ˈaun.ðɛs/}})

===Preposition===
{{head|is|preposition}}

# {{lb|is|with genitive}} [[without]]
#: {{ux|is|Mig langar í bollu, þó '''án''' rjómans!|I want a [[bolla#Icelandic|bolla]], but '''without''' the cream!}}
#: {{ux|is|Litli frændi minn knúsaði mig í tíu mínútur '''án''' þess að segja stakt orð.|My little cousin hugged me for ten minutes '''without''' saying a single word.}}

===Anagrams===
* {{l|is|ná}}

